<title>USA: Micron Technology Q2 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Micron Technology Q2 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>BOISE, Idaho, March 17 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			Feb 27 1997		Feb 29, 1996</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.66	  primary $0.87</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.66	   diluted 0.87</p>
<p> Net		 142,700		  188,200</p>
<p> Revs		876,200		  996,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary215,500		  215,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted216,200		  215,200</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.76	  primary $2.39</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.76	   diluted 2.39</p>
<p> Net		 163,300		  516,700</p>
<p> Revs		1,604,300		2,182,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary215,000		  216,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted215,600		  216,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q297 includes gain of $0.43 per fully diluted shr from sale of subsidiary stock and a gain of $0.05 per fully diluted shr from sale of another investment. Excluding the gains, Q297 oper shr was $0.18/shr.</p>
<p>Q296 includes restructuring charge of $29.9 million.</p>
<p>First Call Q297 consensus was $0.15/shr.</p>
</text>
